{"seq": 14, "event": "status_update", "data": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "01a1ac8c-59fe-787f-b03c-5f8dd1f1fb2f", "result": {"taskId": "01a1ac8c-59fe-787f-b03c-5f8dd1f1fb2f", "contextId": "01a1ac8c-59fd-78a6-9266-d2d188297fe2", "kind": "status-update", "status": {"state": "working", "message": {"kind": "message", "messageId": "01a1ac8d583671d88a42cb19a59c9001", "role": "agent", "parts": [{"kind": "text", "text": "\n\n**Summary in the PDF:** There are 186 open POs worth 2,172,240.01 in total. R&D (433,985.59 across 46 POs) and Operations (423,555.15 across 33 POs) together make up 39.5% of that. Marketing is lowest at 266,077.50 across 22 POs.\n\n| Cost centre | Open POs | Open value |\n|---|---|---|\n| R&D | 46 | 433,985.59 |\n| Operations | 33 | 423,555.15 |\n| Logistics | 29 | 363,994.44 |\n| Facilities | 32 | 359,681.15 |\n| IT | 24 | 324,946.18 |\n| Marketing | 22 | 266,077.50 |\n\n- **Open definition:** \"Open\" means the purchase order status is `open` in the ERP.\n- **Currency:** The ERP gives no currency, so the figures have no currency symbol.\n- **Extras on the page:** Besides the chart and summary, the PDF has a title line and a short source footnote.\n- **Page count:** NW Analyst checked that the PDF has 1 page."}], "taskId": "01a1ac8c-59fe-787f-b03c-5f8dd1f1fb2f", "contextId": "01a1ac8c-59fd-78a6-9266-d2d188297fe2"}, "timestamp": "2026-11-05T16:31:46.742121+00:00"}, "final": false, "metadata": {"agent_name": "agent_01a1a866_2d7e_732c_8d39_e58a10533926"}}}}
